          "settings": {
            "text": "The dentists who get the most from it all have one thing in common: they’d already decided. They weren’t looking to be convinced — they were looking for a route."
          }
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "This book is how people decide. Some will read it and realise ownership isn’t for them, and they’ll have saved themselves years of “one day”. Some will read it and do the whole thing on their own — and I’ll be genuinely delighted, because that’s what it’s written for. A few will get to the end and want help with the build."
          }
        },
        "pull": {
          "type": "pull",
          "settings": {
            "text": "I’d rather this book was in a thousand hands than sold to two hundred."
          }
        },
        "p4": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "You cover the postage because Royal Mail don’t work for free. That’s the entire catch."
          }
        }
